cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
title: "SRNet-ENAS: MATLAB Implementation of Evolutionary Neural Architecture Search"
message: "If you use this software, please cite this software record."
version: "0.1.0"
authors:
  - family-names: "Demir"
    given-names: "Fatih"
    affiliation: "Fırat University"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3210-3664"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FatihDemir23/SRNET-ENAS"
abstract: >-
  A MATLAB reference implementation of evolutionary neural architecture
  search for photovoltaic electroluminescence image classification.
  Includes genetic algorithm search, configurable residual networks,
  final training, and held-out evaluation. This implementation has not
  yet been validated through MATLAB execution and does not claim to
  reproduce the published experimental results.
keywords:
  - neural architecture search
  - genetic algorithm
  - deep learning
  - photovoltaics
  - electroluminescence
  - MATLAB
